  "model_message": "资料不足会影响结论时停止受影响计算，向直接委派者B报告缺项、影响、已查依据和所需答复。没有在线工具，只按受阻结构返回并自然结束。不得改正式约束或发外部消息。补充按200个Unicode字符限制。答案须匹配Q版本、旧attempt和answer；只接受明确后继任务，不自称已恢复。\n{\n  \"andon\": {\n    \"actions\": [],\n    \"match\": [\n      \"question_id\",\n      \"revision\",\n      \"wait_attempt_id\",\n      \"answer_id\"\n    ],\n    \"max_questions\": 4,\n    \"mode\": \"blocked-return\",\n    \"on_answer\": \"explicit-successor\",\n    \"question_route\": \"direct-handler\"\n  },\n  \"attempt_id\": \"attempt-C-1\",\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"formal_change_grants\": [],\n    \"on_missing_grant\": \"request-upstream\"\n  },\n  \"context\": {\n    \"decisions\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"decision-demo\",\n        \"revision\": 7\n      }\n    ],\n    \"fingerprint\": \"sha256:14129a9c5ae6692ea8f5fd495c137e944e4da51045f26d1d5e328a0ca5613988\",\n    \"snapshot_id\": \"ctx-demo-7\"\n  },\n  \"delivery\": {\n    \"format\": \"structured-return/1\",\n    \"supplement_max_code_points\": 200\n  },\n  \"direct_handler\": {\n    \"ref\": \"handler-B\",\n    \"relation\": \"delegated-by\"\n  },\n  \"goal\": \"按批准三年约束比较，不假定缺失许可\",\n  \"inputs\": {\n    \"A\": [\n      100,\n      110,\n      120\n    ],\n    \"B\": [\n      120,\n      110,\n      100\n    ],\n    \"C\": [\n      90,\n      100,\n      110\n    ],\n    \"third_year_data_license\": \"missing\"\n  },\n  \"kind\": \"task\",\n  \"limits\": {\n    \"budget_kind\": \"observed-only\",\n    \"external_messages\": false,\n    \"files\": false,\n    \"tools\": \"deny-all\"\n  },\n  \"operation_id\": \"op-demo-cost\",\n  \"protocol\": \"yuanlei.collaboration/1.0\",\n  \"target\": {\n    \"provider\": \"openclaw\",\n    \"target_ref\": \"target-demo-C\"\n  },\n  \"work\": {\n    \"criteria_revision\": 4,\n    \"id\": \"work-demo\"\n  }\n}",
